# Keep line endings consistent across Windows / macOS / Linux checkouts.
# Without this, editing on Windows (or OneDrive) rewrites every file to CRLF
# and produces huge, meaningless diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must stay LF even on a Windows checkout, or bash chokes.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets: no end-of-line conversion, no diffing.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.bundle binary
